// An event may sync with an act, whose effects then apply.
Fact object Identified by Flower
Fact owner-of Identified by actor * object
Fact nearby Identified by actor * object
Event break Related to object Syncs with destroy(actor, object) When nearby()
Act destroy Actor actor Related to object Creates promise() When owner-of(actor', object)
Duty promise Holder actor Claimant actor' Related to object.
+actor(Alice). +actor(Bob).
+owner-of(Alice, Flower).
+nearby(Bob, Flower).
break(Flower).
?promise(Bob, Alice, Flower).
